p; Software</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</nav>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row gy-4 mb-5\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-5 pe-lg-5\">\n<h2 class=\"h3 fw-bold sl-text-emphasis mb-3\" data-sl-edit=\"text\">SmartLearn Hub</h2>\n<p class=\"sl-text-muted mb-4\" data-sl-edit=\"text\">The world's largest selection of online courses. Learn anytime, anywhere, at your own pace.</p>\n<a class=\"btn sl-btn-primary rounded-pill px-4\" data-sl-edit=\"link\" href=\"#explore-all-courses\">Explore All Courses</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-7\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 mb-4\">\n<h3 class=\"fw-bold sl-text-emphasis mb-3 text-uppercase small\" data-sl-edit=\"text\">Learn</h3>\n<nav aria-label=\"Learn\" class=\"d-flex flex-column gap-2\">\n<a class=\"text-decoration-none sl-text-muted sl-footer-link sl-footer-nav-link\" data-sl-edit=\"link\" href=\"#learning-paths\">Learning Paths</a>\n<a class=\"text-decoration-none sl-text-muted sl-footer-link sl-footer-nav-link\" data-sl-edit=\"link\" href=\"#certifications\">Certifications</a>\n<a class=\"text-decoration-none sl-text-muted sl-footer-link sl-footer-nav-link\" data-sl-edit=\"link\" href=\"#free-courses\">Free Courses</a>\n</nav>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 mb-4\">\n<h3 class=\"fw-bold sl-text-emphasis mb-3 text-uppercase small\" data-sl-edit=\"text\">Community</h3>\n<nav aria-label=\"Community\" class=\"d-flex flex-column gap-2\">\n<a class=\"text-decoration-none sl-text-muted sl-footer-link sl-footer-nav-link\" data-sl-edit=\"link\" href=\"#instructors\">Instructors</a>\n<a class=\"text-decoration-none sl-text-muted sl-footer-link sl-footer-nav-link\" data-sl-edit=\"link\" href=\"#student-forums\">Student Forums</a>\n<a class=\"text-decoration-none sl-text-muted sl-footer-link sl-footer-nav-link\" data-sl-edit=\"link\" href=\"#blog\">Blog</a>\n</nav>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 mb-4\">\n<h3 class=\"fw-bold sl-text-emphasis mb-3 text-uppercase small\" data-sl-edit=\"text\">Support</h3>\n<nav aria-label=\"Support\" class=\"d-flex flex-column gap-2\">\n<a class=\"text-decoration-none sl-text-muted sl-footer-link sl-footer-nav-link\" data-sl-edit=\"link\" href=\"#help-center\">Help Center</a>\n<a class=\"text-decoration-none sl-text-muted sl-footer-link sl-footer-nav-link\" data-sl-edit=\"link\" href=\"#system-requirements\">System Requirements</a>\n<a class=\"text-decoration-none sl-text-muted sl-footer-link sl-footer-nav-link\" data-sl-edit=\"link\" href=\"#contact-us\">Contact Us</a>\n</nav>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"d-flex flex-column flex-md-row justify-content-between align-items-center pt-4 border-top sl-border\">\n<span class=\"small sl-text-muted mb-3 mb-md-0\" data-sl-edit=\"text\">© 2026 SmartLearn Hub. All rights reserved.</span>\n<nav aria-label=\"Legal\" class=\"d-flex gap-3\">\n<a class=\"text-decoration-none small sl-text-muted sl-footer-link\" data-sl-edit=\"link\" href=\"#privacy\">Privacy</a>\n<a class=\"text-decoration-none small sl-text-muted sl-footer-link\" data-sl-edit=\"link\" href=\"#terms\">Terms</a>\n<a class=\"text-decoration-none small sl-text-muted sl-footer-link\" data-sl-edit=\"link\" href=\"#sitemap\">Sitemap</a>\n</nav>\n</div>\n</div>\n</footer>",
  "css": ".sl-footer-mega {\n    padding-top: 4.5rem;\n    background-color: var(--smartlearn-card-bg) !important;\n    font-family: var(--smartlearn-body-font, inherit);\n}\n.sl-footer-mega .sl-text-primary { color: var(--smartlearn-primary) !important; }\n.sl-footer-mega .sl-text-emphasis { color: var(--smartlearn-text) !important; }\n.sl-footer-mega .sl-text-muted { color: var(--smartlearn-text-muted) !important; }\n.sl-footer-mega .sl-icon-subtle {\n    background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--smartlearn-primary) 12%, transparent) !important;\n}\n.sl-footer-mega.sl-border,\n.sl-footer-mega .row.sl-border,\n.sl-footer-mega .pt-4.sl-border { border-color: var(--smartlearn-card-border) !important; }\n\n.sl-footer-mega .sl-btn-primary {\n    background-color: var(--smartlearn-btn-bg) !important;\n    border-color: var(--smartlearn-btn-bg) !important;\n    color: var(--smartlearn-btn-text, #ffffff) !important;\n    transition: background-color 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;\n}\n.sl-footer-mega .sl-btn-primary:hover,\n.sl-footer-mega .sl-btn-primary:focus-visible,\n.sl-footer-mega .sl-btn-primary:active {\n    background-color: var(--smartlearn-btn-hover-bg, var(--smartlearn-btn-bg)) !important;\n    border-color: var(--smartlearn-btn-hover-bg, var(--smartlearn-btn-bg)) !important;\n    color: var(--smartlearn-btn-text, #ffffff) !important;\n    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px color-mix(in srgb, var(--smartlearn-primary) 30%, transparent) !important;\n}\n\n.sl-footer-mega .sl-icon-wrapper { width: 32px; height: 32px; transition: background-color 0.2s ease; }\n.sl-footer-mega .sl-footer-link { transition: color 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease; }\n.sl-footer-mega .sl-footer-link:hover,\n.sl-footer-mega .sl-footer-link:focus-visible {\n    color: var(--smartlearn-primary) !important;\n}\n.sl-footer-mega .sl-footer-nav-link:hover,\n.sl-footer-mega .sl-footer-nav-link:focus-visible {\n    transform: translateX(4px);\n}\n[dir=\"rtl\"] .sl-footer-mega .sl-footer-nav-link:hover,\n[dir=\"rtl\"] .sl-footer-mega .sl-footer-nav-link:focus-visible {\n    transform: translateX(-4px);\n}\n.sl-footer-mega .sl-cat-row:hover .sl-icon-wrapper,\n.sl-footer-mega .sl-cat-row:focus-within .sl-icon-wrapper {\n    background-color: var(--smartlearn-btn-bg) !important;\n}\n.sl-footer-mega .sl-cat-row:hover .sl-icon-wrapper i,\n.sl-footer-mega .sl-cat-row:focus-within .sl-icon-wrapper i {\n    color: var(--smartlearn-btn-text, #ffffff) !important;\n}\n.sl-footer-mega a:focus-visible {\n    outline: 2px solid var(--smartlearn-primary);\n    outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n    .sl-footer-mega .sl-btn-primary,\n    .sl-footer-mega .sl-icon-wrapper,\n    .sl-footer-mega .sl-footer-link { transition: none; }\n    .sl-footer-mega .sl-footer-nav-link:hover,\n    .sl-footer-mega .sl-footer-nav-link:focus-visible { transform: none; }\n}\n",
